<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSSx6" title="In 5.3 Analysis and Ablations ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Spiffy: Multiplying Diffusion LLM Acceleration via Lossless Speculative Decoding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Per-block Acceptance Rates</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
